   framing={'wide':'wide establishing composition showing the named venue landmarks and a clear focal subject','medium':'medium composition: named person/subject and enough environment to identify the venue','close':'close-up of the named subject with just enough quiet context','detail':'tight detail of the actual named part or action, still immediately recognizable'}[plan['start']]
